WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.957
- Well physically I could, but
emotionally and spiritually

00:00:02.957 --> 00:00:04.796
I can't eat at the same place again.

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:06.324
- Let's try someplace new then.

00:00:06.324 --> 00:00:09.526
- Well, your idea of someplace
new scares me a little bit.

00:00:09.736 --> 00:00:10.854
- You guys ordering lunch?

00:00:13.594 --> 00:00:16.759
- Yeah, you know, we were
just thinking about it.

00:00:26.079 --> 00:00:27.338
- You want in, or?

00:00:27.338 --> 00:00:29.538
- Yes, I'm starving!

00:00:29.683 --> 00:00:32.638
Just order me something from
wherever you guys are going.

00:00:32.644 --> 00:00:34.914
You know me, I'm super low-maintenance.

00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:36.203
(bearded man chuckles)

00:00:37.319 --> 00:00:40.212
(whimsical music)

00:01:03.999 --> 00:01:05.144
- So I'm high-maintenance because

00:01:05.144 --> 00:01:06.440
I like things done a certain way?

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.014
(in unison) - Absolutely.

00:01:09.389 --> 00:01:11.145
- My name is Bennett; I ain't even in it.

00:01:11.145 --> 00:01:12.313
- Okay, I don't even
know what you're doing.

00:01:12.313 --> 00:01:15.524
- My name is Paul... It's between ya'all.

00:01:15.524 --> 00:01:18.235
- So you're saying this,
is low maintenance?

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:18.994
- Well...

00:01:18.994 --> 00:01:20.894
- This is what I should aspire to?

00:01:20.894 --> 00:01:23.146
- This is a far more nuanced conversation

00:01:23.146 --> 00:01:23.901
than we should be having.

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:24.788
- But not too nuanced, right?!

00:01:24.788 --> 00:01:27.247
Too nuanced and I might be
labeled "high-maintenance."

00:01:27.247 --> 00:01:29.608
- Look, do you want to
order lunch with us or not?

00:01:29.608 --> 00:01:30.462
- Yes!

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:31.715
- And from where should we order

00:01:31.715 --> 00:01:33.660
this super low-maintenance lunch?

00:01:33.665 --> 00:01:34.682
- Wherever.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:35.866
- Wherever?

00:01:36.011 --> 00:01:39.325
- My name is Guinevere, and
I'd gladly choose anywhere.

00:01:39.772 --> 00:01:40.930
(singsongy) You choose!

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:41.604
- Fine.

00:01:41.604 --> 00:01:42.463
- Fine.

00:01:42.463 --> 00:01:43.531
- How about here?

00:01:43.531 --> 00:01:46.126
The menu smells weird.

00:01:48.911 --> 00:01:49.782
- You know what?

00:01:49.782 --> 00:01:54.782
I am not hungry, so... okay.

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:59.802
- It does smell super weird.

00:01:59.802 --> 00:02:01.149
- You look like a methhead accountant.

00:02:01.149 --> 00:02:01.915
- I'm into it.

00:02:04.945 --> 00:02:07.242
- You know I can't get my
grandfather's inheritance

00:02:07.242 --> 00:02:09.456
unless I have this beard
for three months, okay?

00:02:09.786 --> 00:02:11.992
(outro music)

